{
  "id": "python/python_cliff",
  "title": "5. Cliff Detection",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "5-cliff-detection",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "5. Cliff Detection",
      "anchors": [
        "py_cliff"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Let us give PiCar-X a little self-protection awareness and let it learn to use its own grayscale module to avoid rushing down the cliff."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "In this example, the car will be dormant. If you push it to a cliff, it will be awakened urgently, then back up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "Run the Code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "code",
          "lang": "text",
          "code": "cd ~/picar-x/example\nsudo python3 5.cliff_detection.py",
          "runnable": true,
          "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:light-dark(#fff, #24292e);--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:light-dark(#24292e, #e1e4e8);--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>cd ~/picar-x/example</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sudo python3 5.cliff_detection.py</span></span></code></pre>"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "Code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "admonition",
          "kind": "note",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "t": "p",
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "t": "text",
                  "v": "You can "
                },
                {
                  "t": "strong",
                  "v": "Modify/Reset/Copy/Run/Stop"
                },
                {
                  "t": "text",
                  "v": " the code below. But before that, you need to go to  source code path like "
                },
                {
                  "t": "lit",
                  "v": "picar-x/example"
                },
                {
                  "t": "text",
                  "v": ". After modifying the code, you can run it directly to see the effect."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "code": "from picarx import Picarx\nfrom time import sleep\n\npx = Picarx()\n# px = Picarx(grayscale_pins=['A0', 'A1', 'A2'])\n# manual modify reference value\npx.set_cliff_reference([200, 200, 200])\n\nlast_state = \"safe\"\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    try:\n        while True:\n            gm_val_list = px.get_grayscale_data()\n            gm_state = px.get_cliff_status(gm_val_list)\n            # print(\"cliff status is: %s\" % gm_state)\n\n            if gm_state is False:\n                state = \"safe\"\n                px.stop()\n            else:\n                state = \"danger\"\n                px.backward(80)\n                if last_state == \"safe\":\n                    sleep(0.1)\n\n            last_state = state\n\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nKeyboardInterrupt: stop and exit\")\n\n    finally:\n        px.stop()\n        sleep(0.1)",
          "runnable": true,
          "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:light-dark(#fff, #24292e);--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:light-dark(#24292e, #e1e4e8);--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> picarx </span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Picarx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time </span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sleep</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">px </span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Picarx()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#6A737D, #6A737D);--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># px = Picarx(grayscale_pins=['A0', 'A1', 'A2'])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#6A737D, #6A737D);--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># manual modify reference value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">px.set_cliff_reference([</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#005CC5, #79B8FF);--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#005CC5, #79B8FF);--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#005CC5, #79B8FF);--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">last_state </span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#032F62, #9ECBFF);--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"safe\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#005CC5, #79B8FF);--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __name__</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#032F62, #9ECBFF);--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '__main__'</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:light-dark(#24292E, #E1E4E8);--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:light-dark(#D73A49, #F97583);--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-d